+## 6. Layer 2 — FormationEngine implemented; two derivations still blocked
+
+**Implemented in two separate checkpoints:**
+
+1. **Step A — E-12 migration:** removed the misnamed FormationStructuralType enum and StructuralFeatures.formation_type; legacy/unknown fields now fail explicitly. HistoricalSnapshotQuality and its read-only canonical calibration-weight registry live in Layer 1. Old fixture labels were not converted into quality evidence.
+2. **Step B — FormationEngine:** implemented exactly W/H/C/P/U/Ts from explicit side/depth and role occupancy, after Step A tests passed. The public derive(players, formation) input contract is retained; players are read only for id/role validation.
+
+### Current status
+
+| Component | Current state |
+|---|---|
+| E-12 | **CLOSED** on explicit migrated contracts and construction/derivation test evidence |
+| FormationEngine | **Implemented:** six approved numeric features and descriptive formation_name; no classifier, player-quality input, randomness, or λ |
+| TeamDimensionEngine | **Blocked:** no approved aggregation/role-weight/structural-dependence equations for attack, creation, defense, goalkeeping |
