+
+### Approved and implemented FormationEngine mathematics
+
+For the ten non-GK slots, K=floor(N²/4)=25; connectivity excludes only opposite LEFT/RIGHT pairs:
+
+- W = (left + right outfield slots)/N.
+- H = 0.5, the named, disclosed V1 baseline prior—not inferred line height.
+- C = (back slots + midfield DM slots)/N.
+- P = connected middle/front pairs / K.
+- U = connected back/middle pairs / K.
+- Ts = front slots × non-front outfield slots / K.
+
+The manual standard geometry produces **(.8, .5, .5, .28, .32, .84)**. This is real code execution against explicit test geometry, not a verified historical reconstruction. V3 fields remain inert; no new modeling coefficients were invented.
+
+### Why Layer 2 is not yet entirely complete
+
+The repository defines the Module 2/3 shapes and prior blending, but not the numerical mapping from PlayerSeason abilities/tendencies to the four dimensions and eight identity values. Attribution/scorer/assist weights are not an approved substitute. These derivations require canonical equations or an explicitly approved new mathematical design; their source files remain unchanged and raise clear specification-gap errors.
+
+### Structural transport and real-data limits
+
+F-1(b) is unchanged: future Layer 5 passes TeamModel.identity and TeamModel.structural_features separately to Module 5. No overload of TeamIdentity or TeamRuntimeState was introduced.
+
+Formation Structure ≠ Snapshot Quality ≠ Historical Tier. Snapshot-quality metadata has no runtime strength/identity/λ path. No inferred quality field was added to historical records whose snapshot granularity is not specified.
+
+Full historical data and the two remaining derivations are still missing; end-to-end model reconstruction is not complete.
+
